    motion_language: "Slow interior dollies, screens waking, ambient light shifting hue, a hand interacting with controls, seat and wheel adjusting, cockpit-wide finish.",
    beat_arc: ["Door opens, cabin wakes, ambient light ignites", "Screens, switchgear and material macro in sequence", "Full cockpit reveal from the driver seat"],
    audio_bed: "Soft UI chimes, seat motors, door seal, calm electronic underscore.",
    hook_formula: "Open on one surprising detail most people never notice.",
